      ],
      "source": "https://www.parks.ca.gov/?page_id=485+"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "John Joseph Montgomery, born in Yuba City, pioneered heavier‑than‑air flight in 1905, long before the Wright brothers.",
